0x4854BB4F  SdSpiPortSetup          ; subtype!=4: flush 0xFFFF -> 0x98050004; EXTMD 0x34000280 |= 0x0C00 (SPI-handshake group edge cfg); force slow clock (mode 2)
0x4854BB52  SdSpiPortSetup_entry
