0x4C03D219  LibMsgSend              ; library ROM: post message id d0 to the kernel object of ctrl block a0 (ring-buffer op; disk worker ids 9=cmd, 0xA=done)
0x4C03D36D  LibMsgReceive           ; library ROM: blocking receive of message id d0 into (a0) (the disk-worker task loop)
