0x4C00FE4D  TgZoneSendLevelsCalc    ; (a0 librec, a1 desc2) write the pair librec+0x69/librec+0x6B: desc2+9 >= 0 -> curve[desc2+0x0E] / curve[desc2+0x10] else the negated-mirror variants -- the two effect-send levels merged into the shadow send fields
0x4C00FE4F  TgZoneSendLevelsCalc_entry
